@format 1
@id media-preview.in-split
@title In Split
@section Media preview
@area In Split
@entry split-path-change
@summary Show only the Split-specific step that bridges the shared Files current-path event into the shared viewer-preview pipeline.
@related media-loading.common.files-intake, media-selection.common.files-selection, media-preview.common.viewer-gate
@tag media
@tag preview
@tag split

@alias split = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PSplitTab

[split-path-change] Split Files current-path event <input>
~ This starts when the selected file changes in the Split tab.
[Technical explanation]
= Shared Files logic published the current path through PListPathChange.
> split-path-result

[split-path-result] Split selected-path adapter <decision>
~ The Split tab decides whether the selected file should be opened in the preview.
[Technical explanation]
- Ignore a blank path; otherwise request it from the Split viewer @ split.PSplitPathShow(...)
? "Nonblank current path" > map:media-preview.common.viewer-gate
? "Blank current path" > split-no-request

[split-no-request] Split viewer request omitted <output>
~ This path ends with split viewer request omitted.
[Technical explanation]
= Split does not call the shared viewer-preview pipeline.
